{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1a0078e8861fe2494b21f1dc93d0de65d32fa4dc3a7bb1ab11eb68da2798a662", "ja": "（今日は桃子の初公演だ。\n……緊張してるだろうし、様子を見に行ってみるか）", "zh": "（今天是桃子的首次公演。\n……她应该很紧张吧，去看看状况好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "48cf70eae93557692dc0dc658a0ca2f7f672017b0a1e1e8cf6485b7240fddad2", "ja": "なぁに、お兄ちゃん。\nそんなところでウロウロして……桃子に、何か用？", "zh": "大哥哥，你在干嘛？\n在那边晃来晃去……有事情要找桃子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f803347a6106dc951ad21756f5aa2270e814fbf0524d382b84664ea1da65d835", "ja": "え？　いや、用というか……。\n桃子、今日は初ステージだろ。緊張してないのか？", "zh": "咦？不是，并没有什么事……\n桃子，今天不是你首次登台吗？你不紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "c592f85e9b2b875795f1c379bba0d47741cd56f06006bb1ab3d2c242d2fcbe3a", "ja": "む……。お兄ちゃん？　まさか、桃子が女優だったって\nこと、忘れてるんじゃないよね？", "zh": "唔……大哥哥？你该不会忘记\n桃子以前当过演员了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a304581904dff0fdcb9a5ded0cf10ed020ba59434f54dad1697b6cfc5cf5fd10", "ja": "いや、忘れてはいないけど……。", "zh": "没有啊，我没忘记……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "249e31a787bbff42fd114ce614862cd4a8c9288b1dbe056bd880a1d93870f9aa", "ja": "桃子はこの劇場より、もっと大きな舞台で、\nお芝居したことだってあるんだよ。", "zh": "桃子曾经在比这间剧场\n还要大的舞台上演过戏哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "58fe55cd0711f6d16d26aacae61e227dcbb10dbb34f2088e0e9d1cfa1be94ee3", "ja": "このくらいのステージ、緊張するわけないでしょ。", "zh": "今天舞台规模这么小，桃子怎么可能会紧张嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ce610731217ab260592ef8395a78dbe3253802eecbc26c86b85bafe053169a85", "ja": "そ、そうか……ごめん。\n頼もしいな、さすがは桃子だ。", "zh": "这、这样啊……抱歉。\n你真的很可靠呢，不愧是桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "4baa7bc018c40ea4c7968df301ccd7d0c879c2d54dc697aecc61ff2bc26394fb", "ja": "もう、本番前なのにいっぱい喋らせるから、\n喉渇いちゃった。お兄ちゃん、お水取って。", "zh": "真是的，谁叫你在正式开始前跑来跟桃子讲话，\n害桃子口渴了啦。大哥哥，去拿水来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "81cc29ff7b758f9c021a45e2f0285a30f46db62dd4b54af59f179fff144eb067", "ja": "ああ。\n……ん？", "zh": "好。\n……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "76b6be748c7334491dc77dfd9f48e5f0d064cbc3d8e6c141522d6c1b88edc97c", "ja": "（よく見ると、桃子、少し震えてる……？\n強がって、不安を隠してたのか……）", "zh": "（仔细一看，桃子好像有点发抖……？\n难道她是故作镇定，隐瞒自己的不安吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3039bd3a3e5432e1bc757125d804c9666c8bcf90d8e2fa17026ee2fbead166a1", "ja": "えっと……桃子。", "zh": "那个……桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "2ebfe72ae679e633fa1da6675bfd62935a549b73831ddb65e1ee2fead1e444cf", "ja": "なに？", "zh": "干嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "49999866d45c2b1998d21ff38d330be5fd08db6ea3668c7e64cab8b0882acb3f", "ja": "これから桃子は、アイドルとしていろんな経験をする。\n今日のステージが、そのスタートだ！", "zh": "以后桃子会在偶像这条路上经历许多事情。\n今天这场表演就是起点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "328d23105f1e94c26757f7e550ddf83d146430109bd6ddb2c3659ae4b1e295c2", "ja": "……は？\nき、急に何言って……。", "zh": "……啊？\n你、你干嘛突然讲这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "025c8d93bd769128b4ecc2c528f3508ed30b9b7edb1e1fdd08f09192fa9c6ecf", "ja": "桃子ならきっと、トップアイドルになれる！\nいや、俺が絶対にしてみせる！", "zh": "桃子，你肯定能成为顶尖偶像！\n不，是我一定会把你培育成顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a351829afdd24acffe00214eee3fd235ad74f0ffcc59a546649675b56b7ffe53", "ja": "今日を最高のステージにして、スタートを飾ろう！\n俺にできることは、なんでもするからな！", "zh": "在今天的舞台上大放异彩，漂亮地起跑吧！\n只要是我能力所及，都会尽全力协助！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "997480fe3c18e4bc40512bae4d85becde7d917b384b4d5f2dd66f7a29cc47af0", "ja": "……。\nふ、ふん。", "zh": "……\n哼、哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "29c591570dfba6b0dd1db3b0b7943520647f0f6669aec52b72c915f6280579ee", "ja": "桃子？", "zh": "桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "42c9d2ed58bab286cc5f96bda7076d0037105c58ce2f2ec51d96bac07ed07a8d", "ja": "お兄ちゃんって、本当にデリカシーがないよね。", "zh": "大哥哥，你真的神经很大条耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "f5c7e408fdcd322fd7046e7ac71ea750963301d32a76bc3456544d067f02658f", "ja": "本番前に、そんなプレッシャーになりそうなこと言って\n……桃子が緊張しちゃったら、どうするつもり？", "zh": "在正式演出前给人家施加压力……\n要是桃子听了开始紧张，你要怎么负责？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e91311db4abff97d33ab8491dd400bbef78e846d18bf6159a8f02ded4726168f", "ja": "うっ！\nそ、それもそうだな……すまん……。", "zh": "呜！\n这、这么说也是……抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "c45364d0deb55a20bc15a153d3ad8e63b43b91e83fd7222be4d7f50a15620d85", "ja": "でも……お兄ちゃんが、桃子のことを\nどう考えてるかは、ちょっと伝わった……かな。", "zh": "不过……听了之后，桃子稍微能理解\n大哥哥对桃子的看法了……大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b065253d87369adfdf2c1d29d772d454ef7ef02bb62e3e22e79f127563f06ed6", "ja": "桃子……。", "zh": "桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "5c908bb64bed914b756b939cdf8e2cde538dd3685ca91a0c09d500e9ed897095", "ja": "も、桃子の足を引っ張るとか、承知しないんだから！\nほら、お兄ちゃん！　そろそろステージに行くよ！", "zh": "要、要是敢扯后腿，桃子可饶不了你！\n快走吧，大哥哥！准备过去舞台啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "01fd11af52801417731a0e2bdb9c2e7eb663ee582a554b2ef6148ed32b2cec60", "ja": "いい？　これからしっかりプロデュースして、\nちゃんと、桃子をトップアイドルにしてよね！", "zh": "听好啰！以后要好好地培育桃子，\n一定要让桃子成为顶尖偶像哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1028_p", "source_sha256": "580a82f66bf1c60fc9409966a8d37539ef8e642ea5ad209c7524c03f887b605d", "ja": "ああ、約束だ！", "zh": "好，一言为定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_003_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c68cf935e1b1c8354953f9d03a3d7d78e65771a8e16bef43db2bce8789f00461", "ja": "（前よりは少し、歩み寄れたかな？\n桃子との約束……約束は、守らないとな！）", "zh": "（我和桃子的距离应该比之前更拉近一些了吧？\n如今我和她做了约定……一定要遵守才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
